  "_approach": "Four-bar modern bassline build (near straight): 4/4 kick through bars 1-3, open hats on every offbeat growing louder, snare stepping from silence to 8ths to 16ths, then bar 4 removes the kick so the snare rush (peaking at 127 on the last 16th) and a crash-marked start push into the drop. Ref: TQD 'Vibsing Ting', Skepsis 'Goes Like', Holy Goof build sections. (re-voiced for the Vermona DRM1 MKIII's 8 channels)",
